    "x1": 27540,
    "z1": 20060
   },
   "text": "A hiker. He sat down against the tree and they tore his throat out.\nDogs. The tracks are everywhere."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 6800,
    "z0": 12410,
    "x1": 8500,
    "z1": 13940
   },
   "text": "A strip of green sleeve on a broken branch. A S.T.A.R.S. patch.\nBravo. Someone came through here in the night, running."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 17340,
    "z0": 12920,
    "x1": 19720,
    "z1": 14280
   },
   "text": "ARKLAY TRAIL, west. LOWER STATION, east. CREEK, south.\nSomething's clawed the post."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 18700,
    "z0": 17680,
    "x1": 20400,
    "z1": 20400
   },
   "text": "Paw prints. A lot of them. Big dogs, running south."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 15130,
    "z0": 3910,
    "x1": 17510,
    "z1": 5100
   },
   "text": "The pylon's ladder. There's blood at the foot of it,\ndripping from somewhere up above."
  }
 ],
